- Configured OTAA and EU868 parameters.
- Tested communication through a Dragino gateway connected to TTN.
- Performed serial communication tests and monitored device information.

## Results and Limitations

The work provided practical experience with STM32-based LoRaWAN systems, AT command configuration, and gateway-to-network connectivity.

The complete sensor-data transmission and MQTT dashboard integration were not finalized during the internship. 

